  "Create a key, then choose which projects the assistant can read or edit. New keys have no access by default.": "创建密钥，然后选择助手可以读取或编辑的项目。新密钥默认没有访问权限。",
  "2. Connect your assistant": "2. 连接助手",
  "Advanced OAuth settings": "高级 OAuth 设置",
  "Replace /ABSOLUTE/PATH/SkAItch with your project folder. Claude Desktop starts the local server.": "将 /ABSOLUTE/PATH/SkAItch 替换为项目文件夹路径。Claude Desktop 会启动本地服务器。",
