  "Copy failed. Download the configuration instead.": "复制失败。请改为下载配置。",
  "The connection timed out. Keep the editor open and retry.": "连接超时。请保持编辑器打开并重试。",
  "The key was rejected. Check that it has not been revoked.": "密钥被拒绝。请检查密钥是否已被撤销。",
  "The MCP server cannot access Firebase. Check its server credentials.": "MCP 服务器无法访问 Firebase。请检查服务器凭据。",
  "The MCP server returned an HTTP error.": "MCP 服务器返回了 HTTP 错误。",
  "The editor did not complete the request. Keep SkAItch open with MCP enabled.": "编辑器未完成请求。请保持 SkAItch 打开并启用 MCP。",
  "Invalid MCP response.": "无效的 MCP 响应。",
  "Invalid project list.": "无效的项目列表。",
  "For OAuth, choose project access on the authorization page. For API keys, set project permissions above.": "使用 OAuth 时，请在授权页面选择项目访问权限。使用 API 密钥时，请在上方设置项目权限。",
  "This checks the server and editor with a selected API key. Complete OAuth separately in your assistant. Keep this editor open with MCP enabled.": "此测试使用选定的 API 密钥检查服务器和编辑器。请在助手中单独完成 OAuth 授权。请保持此编辑器打开并启用 MCP。",
  "In Claude settings, add a custom connector with the MCP URL and OAuth. For Claude Desktop configuration, merge the downloaded mcpServers entry into claude_desktop_config.json; Node.js is required.": "在 Claude 设置中，添加使用 MCP URL 和 OAuth 的自定义连接器。配置 Claude Desktop 时，请将下载的 mcpServers 条目合并到 claude_desktop_config.json 中；需要安装 Node.js。",
  "In ChatGPT settings, enable developer mode if available, create an app with the MCP URL and choose OAuth. Availability depends on your account and administrator. There is no configuration file to import.": "在 ChatGPT 设置中，启用开发者模式（如可用），使用 MCP URL 创建应用并选择 OAuth。是否可用取决于你的账户和管理员。无需导入配置文件。",
  "In ChatGPT, add an app with this MCP URL, sign in, and choose which projects to access.": "在 ChatGPT 中，使用此 MCP URL 添加应用，登录并选择允许访问的项目。",
  "Merge the downloaded mcpServers entry into ~/.gemini/settings.json without replacing existing servers. In Gemini CLI, run /mcp auth skaitch for OAuth. This configuration is for Gemini CLI, not the Gemini website.": "将下载的 mcpServers 条目合并到 ~/.gemini/settings.json 中，不要替换现有服务器。在 Gemini CLI 中，运行 /mcp auth skaitch 进行 OAuth 授权。此配置适用于 Gemini CLI，而非 Gemini 网站。",
  "For API key access, set SKAITCH_API_KEY in your environment before launching Gemini CLI.": "使用 API 密钥访问时，请在启动 Gemini CLI 前在环境中设置 SKAITCH_API_KEY。",
  "For API key access in Claude Desktop, replace REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_API_KEY in the downloaded configuration with your key.": "在 Claude Desktop 中使用 API 密钥访问时，请将下载配置中的 REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_API_KEY 替换为你的密钥。",
